- Added `SharedCommandHeader<T>` so a caller-retained clone and the command's
  custom header share mutations. Added fallible response/error header factories
  for Java reflection behavior: response construction returns no command when
  header construction fails, and error-response construction reports
  `NullPointerException` after consuming the opaque ID.
